              "correct_letter": "A",
              "correct_rationale": "Option A is correct. In \"The sticky moisture in the air kissed my face,\" the air (a nonhuman thing) is given the human ability to kiss. In \"The sun was stretching its warmth in every direction,\" the sun (a nonhuman thing) is given the human ability to stretch. Both examples give nonhuman things human actions.",
