        "edit_draft_report.md": "## Edit Pass Complete: MG_STS_XX_G7_1.0_2_v1\n\n### Issues Found and Fixed\n- 0 issues detected, 0 fixed\n\n| Category | Count | Details |\n|----------|-------|---------|\n| (none) | 0 | Draft passed all checks without issues |\n\n### PIA Validation\n- PIA tier: Tier 1 (full lesson plan available)\n- Confidence: HIGH\n\n### PIA Coverage\n\n| # | Analytical Move (from PIA) | Addressed By | Status |\n|---|---------------------------|-------------|--------|\n| 1 | Identify context clues surrounding an unfamiliar word | DQ1, DQ3 | ✓ Covered |\n| 2 | Classify the type of context clue used | DQ1 | ✓ Covered |\n| 3 | Infer the meaning of \"cowered\" from surrounding evidence | Assessment Q1 | ✓ Covered |\n| 4 | Select textual evidence that supports a definition | Assessment Q1, DQ3 | ✓ Covered |\n| 5 | Infer the meaning of \"tuft\" from comparison context clue | Assessment Q2 | ✓ Covered |\n| 6 | Evaluate which definition best fits the context | DQ4, Assessment Q2 | ✓ Covered |\n\n100% coverage — all 6 analytical moves addressed. Target met.\n\n### Curriculum Compliance: StudySync\n\n| Rule Category | Status |\n|---------------|--------|\n| Activity type classification | ✓ (Skills Practice) |\n| Allowed question types | ✓ (MC + TDQ — both allowed) |\n| Question stem rules | ✓ (single-stem only) |\n| Assessment type | ✓ (singleton MC — module plan verbatim override of paired MC default) |\n| MC pairing convention | ✓ (STS-2 override documented: \"MP Target Task\" format from module plan takes priority) |\n| Scaffolding arc | ✓ (3 MC driving questions matches STS-6 norm; selection-heavy per STS-7) |\n| Required elements | ✓ (A/B/C/D labeling per STS-5) |\n| Prohibited elements | ✓ (no violations) |\n| Source boundary (what's lifted vs. authored) | ✓ (TT verbatim preserved exactly) |\n| Cross-curriculum contamination | N/A (no cross-curriculum exemplars used) |\n\n### Grade-Appropriateness: G7 (Band 4)\n\nGrade-appropriateness: G7 — no additional grade checks required (system defaults calibrated for this band).\n\n### Quality Checklist\n\n| Item | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| Verbatim fidelity | ✓ |\n| Paragraph references valid | ✓ |\n| Question progression correct | ✓ |\n| Assessment aligned to target | ✓ |\n| Excerpt complete | ✓ |\n| Source cross-reference (preserve curricula + poetry) | ✓ |\n| All criteria present and specific | ✓ |\n| Word limits met | ✓ |\n| No excluded fields | ✓ |\n| Question types correctly classified | ✓ |\n| Extension compliant | ✓ |\n| Grade-appropriate | ✓ |\n| Paragraph qualifiers restrained | ✓ |\n| Content blocks complete and compliant | ✓ |\n| No TT insight leaking into DQs | ✓ |\n| DQ mutual exclusivity (DQ↔DQ and DQ↔TT) | ✓ |\n| Sequential text progression | ✓ |\n| Numbering convention + completeness + format + multi-excerpt + manifest | ✓ |\n\n### Deterministic Validators (Python)\n\n| Validator | Status | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `verify_objective.py` (Step 4.5) | PASS | Objective preserves all author-named entities |\n| `verify_questions.py` (Step 4.7) | PASS | All 11 checks green |\n\n**Files:**\n- `MG_STS_XX_G7_1.0_2_v1_Activity_Content.md` — validated and corrected\n- `MG_STS_XX_G7_1.0_2_v1_Match_Report.md` — unchanged (reference)\n\nNo issues detected. The draft passed all quality checks.\n\nThe activity is ready for author review. Once edits are complete, use `/move-to-final` to finalize.\n"
